AMIX: ioquake3 as a program for the Z3660's ARM core 1 (files/core1), bare metal:
the platform block, the memory defaults for its heap, one raw sound
stream without VoIP.

diff -ruN a/code/qcommon/common.c b/code/qcommon/common.c
--- a/code/qcommon/common.c	2026-11-08 19:49:54.027440424 +0100
